    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1956627363300876676",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "当安禄山携河北军民打着“清君侧”的名义向洛阳长安进军的时候，所经之处或许并不在意他们是否在谋反。\n\n这些民众更清楚的是自己所遭受的压迫与苦难，他们确信其根源在政府，在朝堂。而此时的安禄山仿佛是带着他们讨还公道的领袖。",
    "created_at": "2025-08-16T08:01:30.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1956626321423180223",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "租庸调制的崩坏，让“无田百姓被逼纳税、豪强权贵却能逃避”，这直接动摇了民众对唐朝的信任感。百姓从“我服从，因为制度有底线”，变成了“朝廷不仁，我凭什么效忠？”——这就是后来大乱不断的重要心理根源。",
    "created_at": "2025-08-16T07:57:22.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1956626299272970243",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "唐朝早年的税收制度为“租庸调制”, 相当于基于田产计算的人头税。\n\n该制度在唐初五十多年里效果尚可，但是到了武则天与唐玄宗时期，已经逐渐崩坏。",
    "created_at": "2025-08-16T07:57:16.000Z",
    "metrics": {
